**[[Passion Land]], [[Glucosamine Desert]], [[Risqué Terrain]], [[Western Street]], [[Sea of Tuna]], [[Bamboo Island]], and [[Neverending Cat Story]].
*The [[Daily Bonus|Cat Stamp]] is not present and [[Tricycle Cat (Special Cat)|Tricycle Cat]] can instead be unlocked by tapping the Cat's [[Splash Text]] 100 times in the [[Cat Base Menu|Cat Base Menu.]]
